{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼互動娛樂公佈《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》PS5版發售初期數據，體驗本作的獨立玩家已超過3900萬。該作由此成為PlayStation歷代主機及掌機中規模最大的遊戲首發，並刷新平台最高同時在線玩家紀錄，統計範圍涵蓋多人遊戲、免費遊戲和單機遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587814.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.397108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:50:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"a51eb0a154ead4715027bd6006e244d839d305fee4369a3c130011b15927b6ff","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}